<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" style="margin:0;padding:0;">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Quick question about KickerGPT</title>
    <style>
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .email-container {
          width: 100% !important;
          margin: 0 !important;
          border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fb;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;"
  >
    <table
      role="presentation"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      width="100%"
      style="background:#f5f7fb;padding:32px 0;"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            class="email-container"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            width="640"
            style="width:640px;max-width:640px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;overflow:hidden;"
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;"
              >
                <div
                  style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111827;"
                >
                  KickerGPT
                </div>
                <div
                  style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.28em;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;"
                >
                  Football intelligence
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 32px 18px;line-height:1.6;font-size:15px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hey {{name}},</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                  I noticed you signed up for KickerGPT but haven't upgraded to Pro.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                  I'm trying to make the product better, and I'd love to understand:
                </p>
                <ol style="margin:0 0 16px 20px;padding:0;color:#111827;">
                  <li style="margin:8px 0;">What did you hope KickerGPT would do for you?</li>
                  <li style="margin:8px 0;">What stopped you from upgrading?</li>
                  <li style="margin:8px 0;">What would make it worth paying for?</li>
                </ol>
                <p style="margin:0 0 14px;">
                  Just hit reply — I read every response.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">Thanks,</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:600;">{{senderName}}</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style="padding:16px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;"
              >
                <a
                  href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}"
                  style="color:#4b5563;text-decoration:underline;"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >
                  Unsubscribe
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
